{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "25e6bf4d-5eff-84e6-b53c-401c98a4907e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T17:34:01-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisa Monteiro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:31:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:31:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good evening. Yes, I am calling after City Hall is closed, I know, but I was told this number takes messages for the storm problems. Is this correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:31:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, you've got the right place. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:31:47-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is the storm drain in front of my house. My name is Marisa Monteiro. I am at 216 Farewell Street, in the North End. After last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday, the water, it does not go down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:32:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is the drain clogged, do you think? Leaves, snow, debris?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:32:06-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, full of leaves and the dirty slush, all on top. And the apron of my driveway, it holds a puddle, and the water runs toward the garage door. Every time it is the same. Every time, and nobody comes. Como se diz... it is too much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:32:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. And this has happened before with this drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:32:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, with the rain, with the snow melting, always the same. I am a little bit tired of calling about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:32:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Is the water in the street too, or just your driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:32:41-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. The street also has a big pool by the corner. And I worry, because the children walk there to the bus, and people with their dogs. They walk right at the edge of the water. With the cold at night, it can freeze also."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:32:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a real concern. So what you're asking is for the crew to come clean that drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:33:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Clean the drain. That is all I ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:33:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll put in a work order for 216 Farewell, storm drain blocked, standing water, ice risk. Is this the best number to reach you, ending in 0162?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:33:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is my home number. It is correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:33:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Crews are still working through a long list from the storm, so it may be a few days, but it's logged now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:33:32-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days. Okay. In the meantime I am buying another snow shovel, because I must push the water away myself. And at the hardware store the shelves are almost empty, so many people need them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:33:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They cleaned out everything after that storm. If the puddle starts freezing over bad before anyone's out, call back and we'll flag it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:33:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will call. Thank you, Denise. Good night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T17:33:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good night, Mrs. Monteiro. Stay warm."
    }
  ],
